    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "medical professionals... they just give you more pills that make you groggy or tell you it's just part of getting old. it doesn't change the fact that i'm losing myself bit by bit. my independence, my strength... it's all just slipping away. i feel like i've already lost the battle, i'm just a ghost in this house waiting for the inevitable. it feels so pointless to keep fighting it.",
