      "content": "it's just hard to see the light at the end of the tunnel when the tunnel is all there is. everything feels so passive. i'm just letting life happen to me, watching it decay. i used to be a person who made decisions, who had agency. now i'm just a passenger in a body that's failing. i wish i could just... i don't know. i wish i could have some kind of say in how this ends instead of just letting it drag on until there's nothing left.",
